# Fetch-on-demand fixtures are multi-MB binaries — never committed.
# Only the fetch manifest lives in git, PLUS the one tiny COMMITTED fixture below.
*
!.gitignore
!fetch.sh
# The minimal 10x trio (~15 KB total) is COMMITTED, not fetched: it is a
# deterministic subsample of the fetched `pbmc3k_raw.h5ad` (see make_mtx_trio.py),
# small enough that every box gets real convert-to-completion coverage with no
# network. Explicit per-file allowlist — do NOT loosen the `*` above.
!make_mtx_trio.py
!mtx_trio/
!mtx_trio/matrix.mtx.gz
!mtx_trio/barcodes.tsv.gz
!mtx_trio/features.tsv.gz
